# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI KEYS GO HERE (server side only). They are never put in the app.
# Copy this file to "supabase/.env", paste your key(s), then run:
#   npx supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/.env
# The file supabase/.env is git-ignored and never ships in the app.
#
# You only NEED the Gemini key. ChatGPT and Claude are optional:
# the app shows each one as "Connected" only when its key is set here.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Required. Get it at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=PASTE-YOUR-GEMINI-API-KEY-HERE
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash

# Optional: ChatGPT (OpenAI). Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Leave the line out (or empty) to keep ChatGPT turned off.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.5

# Optional: Claude (Anthropic). Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
# Leave the line out (or empty) to keep Claude turned off.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
